<title>THAILAND: Siam City Bank '96 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Siam City Bank '96 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for</p>
<p>Siam City Bank for 1996 ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					   Twelve months</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 5.84			5.26</p>
<p>    Net		    3,509.06		   3,160.33</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Siam City Bank Plc, a commercial bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
